tools/*.exe
tools/*.jar

node_modules/

# Session handoffs and scratch notes: written for the next session, not for the
# repo. See CLAUDE.md, "Where documentation goes". Ignored here rather than only
# in a machine-level gitignore, so the convention travels with the checkout -
# two docs CLAUDE.md told sessions to read were lost to exactly that gap.
.claude/
